# Speed Re: Export / Download Fix
# Phase: Working HTML5 Download Button in Brand Detail Export Dialog

[Fix Summary]
1. Problem: ui.Link rendered a standard <a> tag with href="data:application/json;base64,..." without the HTML5 download attribute. Modern browsers reject direct navigation to data: URIs, making the link unresponsive.
2. Resolution: Replaced ui.Link in export dialog with ui.Html rendering an accessible button-styled <a> element with explicit download="{filename}" and href="{data_uri}", allowing instant native file download upon click.
3. Dialog cleanup: Removed redundant cluttered text while retaining raw JSON copy textarea as an auxiliary fallback.
4. Backups created: backups/main.py.bak, backups/schemas.py.bak.

[Verification Command]
uv run pytest tests/test_export_import.py -v
